# NAME: ChatGPT / OpenAI - Surge Complete
# FORMAT: Surge Rule Set
# UPDATED: 2026-09-26
#
# SOURCES:
# 1) OpenAI official ChatGPT network allowlist (primary authority)
# 2) Rabbit-Spec Surge AIGC.list, updated 2026-09-26 (supplemental)
# 3) blackmatrix7 OpenAI.list (legacy cross-check)
#
# DESIGN:
# - Official OpenAI/ChatGPT requirements are retained.
# - Redundant OpenAI subdomains are collapsed into DOMAIN-SUFFIX rules.
# - Rabbit-Spec entries are added only when they are strongly tied to OpenAI/ChatGPT.
# - Broad shared third-party suffixes (all of Stripe/Sentry/Auth0/Cloudflare/etc.) are NOT
#   imported wholesale, to avoid routing unrelated apps through the ChatGPT policy.
# - ChatGPT Voice dynamic UDP 3478 IP ranges are intentionally not hard-coded.
#
# ============================================================
# OpenAI official core
# ============================================================

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com

# Static assets / uploads / telemetry
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com

# Email / verification
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ct.sendgrid.net

# Support / frontend dependencies
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com

# OpenAI CDN
DOMAIN,cdn.openaimerge.com

# WorkOS authentication dependencies
DOMAIN,cdn.workos.com
DOMAIN,forwarder.workos.com
DOMAIN,images.workoscdn.com
DOMAIN,setup.workos.com
DOMAIN,workos.imgix.net

# Cloudflare challenge
DOMAIN,challenges.cloudflare.com

# Payment
DOMAIN,js.stripe.com

# Diagnostics / telemetry
DOMAIN,o207216.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,rum.browser-intake-datadoghq.com

# Apple native-app dependency
DOMAIN,humb.apple.com

# ============================================================
# Rabbit-Spec supplemental OpenAI / ChatGPT infrastructure
# ============================================================

# OpenAI-specific CDN / storage
DOMAIN,chat.openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,openaicom-api-bdcpf8c6d2e9atf6.z01.azurefd.net
DOMAIN,openaicomproductionae4b.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN,production-openaicom-storage.azureedge.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openaiapi-site.azureedge.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openaicom.imgix.net

# Arkose anti-abuse / challenge
DOMAIN,openai-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,client-api.arkoselabs.com

# LiveKit / realtime-related infrastructure
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,host.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,turn.livekit.cloud

# ============================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================
# Covered implicitly by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com:
#   *.auth.openai.com
#   auth0.openai.com
#   setup.auth.openai.com
#   chat.openai.com
#   desktop.chat.openai.com
#   ios.chat.openai.com
#   android.chat.openai.com
#   tcr9i.chat.openai.com
#
# Covered implicitly by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com:
#   ws.chatgpt.com
#   ChatGPT/Codex WebSocket endpoints on TCP 443
#
# ChatGPT Voice:
#   OpenAI currently prefers UDP 3478 and publishes dynamic server IP ranges.
#   Those addresses may change, so fixed IP-CIDR entries are intentionally omitted.
